# android.hardware.radio@1.4-service.legacy is a client of the IRadio 1.0 HAL
# that rild serves and a server of IRadio 1.4 to the framework. Both rild and
# the wrapper are hal_telephony servers, so the server-to-client binder rules
# of hal_telephony do not cover calls between them: the wrapper calls rild,
# and rild delivers IRadioResponse and IRadioIndication callbacks back into
# the wrapper.
binder_call(hal_radio_default, rild)
binder_call(rild, hal_radio_default)
